{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_51_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_51","textTraditional":"一、二十有二年，春王正月，肆大省。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_51_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_51","textTraditional":"肆者何？跌也。大省者何？災省也。肆大省何以書？譏。何譏爾？譏始忌省也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_51_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_51","textTraditional":"二、癸丑，葬我小君文姜。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_51_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_51","textTraditional":"文姜者何？莊公之母也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_51_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_51","textTraditional":"三、陳人殺其公子禦寇","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_51_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_51","textTraditional":"四、秋七月丙申，及齊高傒盟于防。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_51_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_51","textTraditional":"齊高傒者何？貴大夫也。曷為就吾微者而盟？公也。公則曷為不言公？諱與大夫盟也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_51_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_51","textTraditional":"五、冬，公如齊納幣。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_51_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_51","textTraditional":"納幣不書，此何以書？譏。何譏爾？親納幣，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}